# Pin LF for everything git detects as text. Shebang scripts, JSON, Markdown and checked-in SVGs are
# executed, hashed, or compared byte for byte; a CRLF checkout (Windows core.autocrlf=true) breaks
# vitest ("#!/usr/bin/env node\r" -> SyntaxError) and byte-compare tests. See #399.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets stay untouched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.tgz binary
